        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've uploaded the first draft of the Youth Wellbeing Workshop Curriculum Pack (A4) for T3. It outlines 8 potential session topics. I'd appreciate your thoughts on the flow and content.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 98920,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "At the same time, I have put together a draft protocol for the Oral Health sessions (A5) as part of T5. It includes the main talking points and a list of materials I think we will need.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "page_facing_up",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 1424,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "Looking at A4, the topics seem good. Maybe we could do the 'stress management' one earlier? A lot of the young people I talk to are worried about exams.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "That's a great suggestion, @1424. We can definitely be flexible with the order. Let's tentatively agree to move 'Stress Management' to week 2. If everyone is happy with the general topics, we can get approval for the initial set (D5).",
            "mentions": [
              1424
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 61769,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "The curriculum in A4 looks very comprehensive. Once the topics are locked in (D5), I can start formatting the handouts and materials for each session.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 522004,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "I've reviewed the oral health protocol in A5. It seems practical. @98920, have you considered the time constraints? The schedule will be tight, so we need to be sure the activities are feasible (D6). A 15-minute talk plus a 5-minute screening per person could take a long time for a large group.",
            "mentions": [
              98920
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 98920,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "That is a good point. Maybe the screening is not for everyone. We could do the talk for the whole group and then offer the screening only to those who are interested and have questions?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "That sounds like a very sensible adjustment, @98920. It keeps the activity manageable and respects the young people's choice. Let's decide on that approach. Decision D6: The oral health sessions will consist of a group awareness talk, followed by optional, one-to-one screenings for interested participants. This seems feasible.",
            "mentions": [
              98920
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 98920,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "Ok, I will update the protocol in A5. I also need to work on T11, the inventory checklist. I will use the materials list from A5 to create the checklist (A7).",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T11",
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 1424,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "I'm happy with the workshop topics in A4.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
