      {
        "thread_id": "TH5",
        "thread_goal": "Review early pilot data, adjust approach, and plan evaluation outputs.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M69",
            "speaker_id": 1424,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi everyone, as part of T10 I've been monitoring the first few weeks of the pilot. I've put together a quick summary of attendance based on the data from A3. Turnout has been okay at the schools, but very low at the library.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M70",
            "speaker_id": 522004,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "Thanks for flagging this, @1424. I've started compiling the data for T12, and I'm seeing the same pattern. The library sessions have an average of only 2-3 attendees, while the others are closer to 10-12.",
            "mentions": [
              1424
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M71",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M70",
            "text": "This is valuable early feedback. It seems the library is not an effective outreach location for this specific group. We should consider making a mid-pilot adjustment. What are the alternatives?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M72",
            "speaker_id": 1424,
            "reply_to": "M71",
            "text": "We could try moving the Wednesday session to the skate park? It's near the library, but it's where a lot of young people actually hang out. It might be better for outreach.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M73",
            "speaker_id": 61769,
            "reply_to": "M72",
            "text": "That's a good idea. We'd need to update the promotional materials quickly if we make that change.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M74",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M72",
            "text": "I like that idea. It's responsive to what we're learning. There are safeguarding implications for a more informal outdoor setting, but our existing procedures should cover it. Let's propose this as a key adjustment for our final evaluation report (A8).",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M75",
            "speaker_id": 522004,
            "reply_to": "M74",
            "text": "From a logistics standpoint, the skate park is feasible. It doesn't change our travel times significantly. We should document this change clearly for the evaluation, noting the reason and the outcome.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M76",
            "speaker_id": 98920,
            "reply_to": "M72",
            "text": "Would we do the oral health sessions at the skate park? We would need a quiet place for the one-to-one screenings.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M77",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "Good point, @98920. We probably wouldn't. The skate park would be for outreach and informal chats. We can keep the more structured health and wellbeing sessions to the schools and community centres. This is another important detail for the evaluation report (A8).",
            "mentions": [
              98920
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M78",
            "speaker_id": 1424,
            "reply_to": "M77",
            "text": "So we are agreeing to change the location?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M79",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M78",
            "text": "Yes, let's make a decision. Decision D8: We will make a mid-pilot adjustment to replace the library outreach session with one at the local skate park, starting next week. For the final evaluation (A8), we will highlight this change as a key lesson in responsive programming and note that different activities require different types of venues.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M80",
            "speaker_id": 522004,
            "reply_to": "M79",
            "text": "Confirmed. I'll update the master schedule and continue tracking the data from the new location for T12.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M81",
            "speaker_id": 61769,
            "reply_to": "M79",
            "text": "Understood. I'll get the updated materials ready.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M82",
            "speaker_id": 1424,
            "reply_to": "M79",
            "text": "Great. I will continue with T10 and report back on how the new location works out.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M83",
            "speaker_id": 98920,
            "reply_to": "M79",
            "text": "Ok.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M84",
            "speaker_id": 89329,
            "reply_to": "M79",
            "text": "Excellent. This is exactly the kind of adaptive management we need for a successful pilot. Thanks everyone for the quick and constructive input.",
            "mentions": [],
